      "statement": "An FM v5 document is a manifest plus three flat collections (entities, relationships, rules); the manifest fixes type fm_model, schemaVersion 5.0, ruleLanguage CEL, a semver version and a non-empty unique entryContextRefs list, and the JSON Schema forbids additional fields.",
