      "statement": "Every non-contract Evidence must name a responsibleRoleRef that resolves to a Party Role owned by its Context (a pre-contract stage borrows its parent Contract's parties), while a Contract must belong to a Contract Context, be listed in that Context's rootRefs, and carry exactly two distinct Party Roles from that Context.",
