      "id": "claim_7c4a8174282247a2b377c1c6159e88b7",
      "statement": "Relationships allow only plays_role and references; self relationships and Contract-to-Contract connections are refused; plays_role accepts participant.party to role.party or role.third_party, participant.thing to role.domain, a Context to role.context, or a moment Evidence (fulfillment_confirmation, other_evidence, contract) to role.evidence; interval Evidence behind an Evidence Role is rejected with relationship.playsRole.momentOnly, and a moment player must come from another Context.",
